</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="font-style:italic">Proposal Three-Ratification of Independent Public Accountant:</span> To ratify BDO USA, P.C. to serve as the Company&#8217;s independent registered public accounting firm for its 2026 fiscal year. In accordance with the voting results listed below, BDO USA, P.C. was ratified by over 98% of the votes cast and BDO USA, P.C. will serve as the independent registered certified public accountants for the Company&#8217;s fiscal 2026. </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
