</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="font-style:italic">Proposal Four-Reverse Stock Split Proposal:</span> To approve an amendment to the Company&#8217;s Amended and Restated Articles of Incorporation to effect a reverse stock split with respect to the Company&#8217;s issued and outstanding common stock, at a ratio ranging from any whole number between <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span style="white-space:nowrap">1-for-2</span></span> and <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span style="white-space:nowrap">1-for-100,</span></span> with the final ratio and exact timing to be determined by the board of directors in its discretion, subject to the authority of the board of directors to abandon such amendment. In accordance with the voting results listed below, the reverse stock split has been approved by 91.42% of the votes cast </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
